step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Speak with Wizard Persten west of the Emir's Arena to obtain the eye amulet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Mage of Zamorak at the Altar of Chaos in south-eastern Varrock; use the eye amulet on him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Tea Seller at the eastern entrance to Varrock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the strong cup of tea on the Mage of Zamorak, and accept the teleport to the Abyss.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the eye amulet on the Dark Mage.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Now there will be runic energies surrounding the rift. Touch each colour until they all turn white; the order is random for every player. Remember the order as you try out different combinations as it will reset with each failed order.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Speak with Wizard Persten west of the Emir's Arena to obtain the eye amulet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Mage of Zamorak at the Altar of Chaos in south-eastern Varrock; use the eye amulet on him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Tea Seller at the eastern entrance to Varrock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the strong cup of tea on the Mage of Zamorak, and accept the teleport to the Abyss.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the eye amulet on the Dark Mage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Now there will be runic energies surrounding the rift. Touch each colour until they all turn white; the order is random for every player. Remember the order as you try out different combinations as it will reset with each failed order.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to the Dark Mage to receive an <col=800000>abyssal incantation</col>.</col>
step	8	-	Quick guide step 8
line	<str>Speak with Wizard Persten west of the Emir's Arena to obtain the eye amulet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Mage of Zamorak at the Altar of Chaos in south-eastern Varrock; use the eye amulet on him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Tea Seller at the eastern entrance to Varrock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the strong cup of tea on the Mage of Zamorak, and accept the teleport to the Abyss.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the eye amulet on the Dark Mage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Now there will be runic energies surrounding the rift. Touch each colour until they all turn white; the order is random for every player. Remember the order as you try out different combinations as it will reset with each failed order.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Dark Mage to receive an abyssal incantation.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go back to <col=800000>Wizard Persten</col> in Al Kharid (Recommend exiting the abyss via Fire Altar, will place you just east of Persten) talk to him and accept the teleport to the <col=800000>Wizards' Tower</col>.</col>
step	9	-	Quick guide step 9
line	<str>Speak with Wizard Persten west of the Emir's Arena to obtain the eye amulet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Mage of Zamorak at the Altar of Chaos in south-eastern Varrock; use the eye amulet on him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Tea Seller at the eastern entrance to Varrock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the strong cup of tea on the Mage of Zamorak, and accept the teleport to the Abyss.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the eye amulet on the Dark Mage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Now there will be runic energies surrounding the rift. Touch each colour until they all turn white; the order is random for every player. Remember the order as you try out different combinations as it will reset with each failed order.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Dark Mage to receive an abyssal incantation.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to Wizard Persten in Al Kharid (Recommend exiting the abyss via Fire Altar, will place you just east of Persten) talk to him and accept the teleport to the Wizards' Tower.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the basement and use the abyssal incantation on <col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col>.</col>
