line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Felix, then take a weak cell from the table.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara, then place the weak cell on the inactive cell tile near her.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Felix.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take a weak cell from the table, then click on the essence pile to assemble a guardian.</str>
line	
line	<str>Repeat the previous step for the other essence pile.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Mine five guardian fragments from the guardian remains.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Felix.</str>
line	
line	<str>Work at the workbench to turn guardian fragments into guardian essence.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take an uncharged cell from the table.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the Mind Altar and click the altar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click the weak cell tile, then power-up The Great Guardian.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Repeat the process of mining five guardian fragments and turning them into guardian essence.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the Water Altar and click the altar</str>
line	
line	<str>Power-up The Great Guardian.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click on the Essence pile again to assemble another guardian.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Repeat the process of mining guardian fragments and turning them into guardian essence.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take an uncharged cell from the table and use the water portal talisman on the water guardian.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click the Water Altar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the altar and speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the cell you made on the cell tile.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Apprentice Tamara.</str>
line	
line	<str>Power-up The Great Guardian.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Upon completion of the tutorial, you will automatically exit and speak to Archmage Sedridor.</col>
done	<str>Speak with Wizard Persten west of the Emir's Arena to obtain the eye amulet.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go to the Mage of Zamorak at the Altar of Chaos in south-eastern Varrock; use the eye amulet on him.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak to the Tea Seller at the eastern entrance to Varrock.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the strong cup of tea on the Mage of Zamorak, and accept the teleport to the Abyss.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the eye amulet on the Dark Mage.</str>
done	
done	<str>Now there will be runic energies surrounding the rift. Touch each colour until they all turn white; the order is random for every player. Remember the order as you try out different combinations as it will reset with each failed order.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak to the Dark Mage to receive an abyssal incantation.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go back to Wizard Persten in Al Kharid (Recommend exiting the abyss via Fire Altar, will place you just east of Persten) talk to him and accept the teleport to the Wizards' Tower.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go to the basement and use the abyssal incantation on Archmage Sedridor.</str>
